## Further Reading

- [REALM: Retrieval-Augmented Language Model Pre-Training](https://arxiv.org/abs/2002.08909) — original RAG paper
- [RAGAS](https://github.com/explodinggradients/ragas) — automated RAG evaluation framework
- [Sentence Transformers documentation](https://sbert.net/) — embedding models
- [ChromaDB documentation](https://docs.trychroma.com/) — vector database
- [Lost in the Middle](https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172) — why chunk position in context matters
